Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:08:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Darkrai ex: Nightmare Aura triggers on any attachment
 from the Energy Zone (#434)

Nightmare Aura reads "Whenever you attach a [D] Energy from your Energy Zone
to this Pokemon", the same wording as Charizard's Flame Aura, which already
uses only_turn_energy: false. Darkrai ex now does too, so an effect that
attaches [D] from the Energy Zone triggers it, not only the turn's attachment.

Tests: tests/pokemon/darkrai_ex_test.rs (an effect attachment of 1 [D] does
20 to the opponent's Active; a non-[D] effect attachment does nothing; the
turn attachment test is unchanged).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
